    {
      "id": "claim_0b9d1a38a06148e797be6ab240a4c9d4",
      "statement": "Candidate builds run cargo build --release --locked on three native targets (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, aarch64-apple-darwin), verify celld --version matches the crate manifest version, and package gzip -9 -n -c so the envelope is reproducible whenever the binary is — assets are binaries only, integrity supplied by the attestation plus per-asset digests and gzip CRC.",
