      "statement": "Container phase enforces tag-vs-manifest validation (the release tag must equal v$version read from crates/celld/Cargo.toml), builds per-arch images with --provenance=mode=max and --sbom=true, and publishes to ghcr under immutable sha-/version-/latest tags stitched into a multi-arch manifest which is itself attested and verified for anonymous pull before success.",
